---
---

<section class="py-32 px-6 bg-paper-50" id="testimonials">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-violet-600 uppercase tracking-[0.1em] mb-4"><span class="text-violet-600">■</span> TESTIMONIALS</p>
      <h2 class="font-sans font-[400] text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight text-text-900 mb-6">Dental professionals <span class="font-serif italic text-violet-600">love RetainOS.</span></h2>
    </div>

    <!-- 2x2 testimonial grid -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-x-16 gap-y-12">
      <!-- Card 1: Dr. Rebecca Chen -->
      <div class="relative pl-14">
        <svg class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-10 h-10 text-violet-200 select-none" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M9.983 3v7.391c0 5.704-3.731 9.57-8.983 10.609l-.995-2.151c2.432-.917 3.995-3.638 3.995-5.849h-4v-10h9.983zm14.017 0v7.391c0 5.704-3.748 9.571-9 10.609l-.996-2.151c2.433-.917 3.996-3.638 3.996-5.849h-3.983v-10h9.983z"/></svg>
        <div class="flex gap-1 mb-3">
          {Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (
            <span class="text-violet-400 text-lg">★</span>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="text-text-900 font-sans leading-relaxed mb-6">"We replaced 5 separate tools with RetainOS. Our no-show rate dropped from 18% to under 4% in the first month. The recall automation alone pays for itself."</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-violet-600/20 flex items-center justify-center text-violet-600 text-sm font-bold">RC</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-text-900">Dr. Rebecca Chen</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-600">Smile Clinic, San Francisco</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Dr. Michael Torres -->
      <div class="relative pl-14">
        <svg class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-10 h-10 text-violet-200 select-none" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M9.983 3v7.391c0 5.704-3.731 9.57-8.983 10.609l-.995-2.151c2.432-.917 3.995-3.638 3.995-5.849h-4v-10h9.983zm14.017 0v7.391c0 5.704-3.748 9.571-9 10.609l-.996-2.151c2.433-.917 3.996-3.638 3.996-5.849h-3.983v-10h9.983z"/></svg>
        <div class="flex gap-1 mb-3">
          {Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (
            <span class="text-violet-400 text-lg">★</span>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="text-text-900 font-sans leading-relaxed mb-6">"The loyalty program changed everything. Our 5-star reviews went from 12 to 47 in 3 months. Patients actually compete for the Gold tier — it's wild."</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-violet-600/20 flex items-center justify-center text-violet-600 text-sm font-bold">MT</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-text-900">Dr. Michael Torres</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-600">Metro Dental, Austin</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Dr. Priya Sharma -->
      <div class="relative pl-14">
        <svg class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-10 h-10 text-violet-200 select-none" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M9.983 3v7.391c0 5.704-3.731 9.57-8.983 10.609l-.995-2.151c2.432-.917 3.995-3.638 3.995-5.849h-4v-10h9.983zm14.017 0v7.391c0 5.704-3.748 9.571-9 10.609l-.996-2.151c2.433-.917 3.996-3.638 3.996-5.849h-3.983v-10h9.983z"/></svg>
        <div class="flex gap-1 mb-3">
          {Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (
            <span class="text-violet-400 text-lg">★</span>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="text-text-900 font-sans leading-relaxed mb-6">"Our patients love the branded app. They use it for booking, payments, aftercare checklists — it's like having our front desk in their pocket. Retention went up 40%."</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-violet-600/20 flex items-center justify-center text-violet-600 text-sm font-bold">PS</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-text-900">Dr. Priya Sharma</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-600">Prime Smiles, Chicago</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Dr. James O'Brien -->
      <div class="relative pl-14">
        <svg class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-10 h-10 text-violet-200 select-none" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M9.983 3v7.391c0 5.704-3.731 9.57-8.983 10.609l-.995-2.151c2.432-.917 3.995-3.638 3.995-5.849h-4v-10h9.983zm14.017 0v7.391c0 5.704-3.748 9.571-9 10.609l-.996-2.151c2.433-.917 3.996-3.638 3.996-5.849h-3.983v-10h9.983z"/></svg>
        <div class="flex gap-1 mb-3">
          {Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (
            <span class="text-violet-400 text-lg">★</span>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="text-text-900 font-sans leading-relaxed mb-6">"DSO analytics across 14 locations used to take my ops director 3 days. Now it's a dashboard refresh. Cross-practice recall rates jumped 34% in one quarter."</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-violet-600/20 flex items-center justify-center text-violet-600 text-sm font-bold">JO</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-text-900">Dr. James O'Brien</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-600">Jackson Ortho, 14 locations</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom trust band -->
    <div class="mt-20 pt-12 border-t border-paper-line">
      <p class="text-center text-xs font-semibold text-violet-600 uppercase tracking-[0.1em] mb-8">Trusted by leading dental clinics</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-8 md:gap-12">
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-600 opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">Smile Clinic</span>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-600 opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">Metro Dental</span>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-600 opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">Prime Smiles</span>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-600 opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">Jackson Ortho</span>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-600 opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">Bright Dental</span>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-600 opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">Care Partners</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
